  <h1>DashMize Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="notice"><strong>UAT Draft:</strong> This policy is a placeholder. It must be completed to reflect actual data processing practices before collecting real customer data.</p>

  <h2>1. Information Collected</h2>
  <p>The registration system may collect a user's name, hotel name, email address, mobile number and authentication-related information.</p>

  <h2>2. Purpose of Processing</h2>
  <p>Information is intended to support account registration, authentication, security, password recovery and operation of the Hotel ERP platform.</p>

  <h2>3. Authentication Services</h2>
  <p>DashMize UAT uses Supabase authentication. Email, SMS and Google authentication services may process information necessary to deliver their respective functions.</p>

  <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
  <p>Appropriate technical and organizational safeguards should be implemented to protect account information. No online service can guarantee absolute security.</p>

  <h2>5. Cookies and Sessions</h2>
  <p>The platform may use browser storage or similar technologies to maintain authenticated sessions and support essential application functions.</p>

  <h2>6. Retention</h2>
  <p>Specific retention periods and deletion procedures must be established before the commercial launch.</p>

  <h2>7. User Requests</h2>
  <p>Procedures for accessing, correcting or requesting deletion of personal information will be finalized before production use.</p>

  <h2>8. Policy Updates</h2>
  <p>This draft may be revised as the platform and its data processing practices develop.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>Official privacy contact details will be added after confirmation by DashMize LLP.</p>
